    "reduceV": "actual successful execution S=3, BN=2, BD=1; two blocks and a padded tail; probabilities [1,2^-25,1], V=1; software output 2 while exact rational sum is 2+2^-25.",
    "mistral": "actual successful execution attSeq=1, seqLen=2, window=2, BN=2, BD=1; padded P lane1=+0 with live V lane1=+Inf; software result qNaN and frame preserved."
